- Reflections in the water (y 906–1050).
- The near birches (rework the black slabs).
- The figure on the bank.
- The fallen birch.
- Atmospheric refinement: the mist band is too wide/uniform; the sky needs cloud modelling; the water needs horizontal ripple strokes.

